stateDiagram-v2
    state if_state <<choice>>
    [*] --> IsPositive
    IsPositive --> if_state
    if_state --> False: if n < 0
    if_state --> True: if n >= 0
    state fork_state <<fork>>
    True --> fork_state
    fork_state --> Left
    fork_state --> Right
    state join_state <<join>>
    Left --> join_state
    Right --> join_state
    join_state --> [*]
